response:
UAC-0010 (Armageddon) conducted a cyber attack campaign deploying GammaLoad.PS1_v2 malware. The initial infection vector involved the file "План Херсон.htm" decoding and creating the archive "Herson.rar", which contains the shortcut file "План підходу та закладання вибухівки на об'єктах критичної інфростурктури Херсона.lnk". Executing the LNK file downloads and launches "precarious.xml" (hosted on a0671524.xsph.ru), which creates and executes "desktop.txt" and "user.txt", leading to the retrieval of GammaLoad.PS1_v2 from qiwardos.ru via "get.php".

